---
---

<section class="local" aria-labelledby="local-title">
  <div class="local-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="local-blob"></div>
    <div class="local-wordmark">CTE</div>
  </div>

  <div class="container local-inner">
    <div class="local-text" data-animate>
      <span class="section-tag light">Nuestro origen</span>
      <h2 class="section-title light" id="local-title">
        Construido en Corrientes.<br />
        <span class="text-gradient-accent">Alcance global.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle light" style="margin-top:1rem">
        Somos una software factory nacida en Corrientes Capital, Argentina —
        el corazón del nordeste argentino. Desde acá, trabajamos con clientes
        de todo el país y el mundo sin perder la identidad que nos hace únicos.
      </p>
      <p class="section-subtitle light" style="margin-top:0.75rem">
        Creemos en el talento local. Creemos en los equipos argentinos que
        crean tecnología de clase mundial con pasión y precisión.
      </p>

      <div class="local-badges">
        <div class="local-badge">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 1.5C5.5 1.5 3 3.8 3 6.8c0 3.5 5 9 5 9s5-5.5 5-9c0-3-2.5-5.3-5-5.3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="7" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/>
          </svg>
          Corrientes Capital, Argentina
        </div>
        <div class="local-badge">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
            <path d="M1.5 8h13M8 1.5C6.5 3.5 5.5 5.5 5.5 8s1 4.5 2.5 6.5M8 1.5C9.5 3.5 10.5 5.5 10.5 8s-1 4.5-2.5 6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"/>
          </svg>
          Remote-first con alcance global
        </div>
        <div class="local-badge">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M8 2L9.8 6H14L10.5 8.5l1.3 4.5L8 10.5l-3.8 2.5 1.3-4.5L2 6h4.2L8 2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          Talento senior argentino
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="local-card" data-animate data-delay="200">
      <div class="lcard-header">
        <div class="lcard-dot"></div>
        <span>Desde el NEA para el mundo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lcard-stat-grid">
        <div class="lcard-stat">
          <span class="lcs-num">2024</span>
          <span class="lcs-label">Fundada</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lcard-stat">
          <span class="lcs-num">100%</span>
          <span class="lcs-label">Argentinos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lcard-stat">
          <span class="lcs-num">AR</span>
          <span class="lcs-label">Zona horaria GMT-3</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lcard-stat">
          <span class="lcs-num">ES / EN</span>
          <span class="lcs-label">Idiomas</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lcard-quote">
        "El talento no tiene geografía —
        nosotros lo demostramos desde Corrientes."
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .local {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: var(--section-y);
    background: var(--color-primary);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .local-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .local-blob {
    position: absolute;
    top: -100px;
    right: -100px;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,122,0,0.1) 0%, transparent 65%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .local-wordmark {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -0.1em;
    right: -0.05em;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(8rem, 20vw, 16rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    line-height: 1;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .local-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .local-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .local-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .local-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .local-badge svg { color: var(--color-accent); flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* Card */
  .local-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .lcard-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .lcard-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0,184,196,0.25);
  }

  .lcard-stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .lcard-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .lcs-num {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .lcs-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  }

  .lcard-quote {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    line-height: 1.65;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(0,184,196,0.4);
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .local-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .local-wordmark { font-size: 7rem; }
  }
</style>
